  "note": "The career database imports real-player identities and published shirt numbers into new careers for all 20 Premier League clubs, all 20 Serie A clubs, all 18 Bundesliga clubs, all 18 Ligue 1 clubs and the LaLiga roster tranche in this dataset (96 clubs / 2,745 player entries total (20 Premier League + 76 across LaLiga, Serie A, Bundesliga and Ligue 1)). Source quality varies by club: official club squad pages are preferred; UEFA registration lists are used for clubs where accessible; AJ Auxerre and RC Strasbourg use independent roster pages cross-checked with official club/league announcements. Shirt numbers are omitted when the cited source does not establish them or conflicting numbers appear. Player ratings, tactical positions, DOB, nationality, wages, contracts and attributes remain game-generated; no claims are made that these are official game ratings."
